    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/88b67b70bab01555781dadecd07a03de.avif?t=1755534344\" width=600 height=130 /></span><strong>No ammo, not much special weapon, you are on your own to survive the horror!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape from the doctors and creatures if you don't want a passive painful radioactive gas death. Everything is corrupted here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one and only friend are small bottles of holy water and your courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Lord is near to all who call on him, to all who call on him in truth&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/8635a97e0a75a3130e9d6ab2d065b486.poster.avif?t=1755534344\" width=684 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/8635a97e0a75a3130e9d6ab2d065b486.webm?t=1755534344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/8635a97e0a75a3130e9d6ab2d065b486.mp4?t=1755534344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cult Trials: Incarnation you are Amelia, who woke up from deep-death sleep and found herself in a dark corrupted world. Deep mystery awaits you as you slowly dive deep  and follow the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is going to be a trilogy of 3 chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot; We stood and watched as God abandoned us, and then we did the best we could &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/acb2b443d36e7035ab43ecae683e17fd.poster.avif?t=1755534344\" width=634 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/acb2b443d36e7035ab43ecae683e17fd.webm?t=1755534344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/acb2b443d36e7035ab43ecae683e17fd.mp4?t=1755534344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore environments and Intense Psychological Horror</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/7ae909f7c37a08bb85156e57d03ceef3.poster.avif?t=1755534344\" width=630 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/7ae909f7c37a08bb85156e57d03ceef3.webm?t=1755534344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/7ae909f7c37a08bb85156e57d03ceef3.mp4?t=1755534344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome Puzzles, Actions, and Secrets to Uncover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/54163e2f6973d65fdae2b4075a511156.poster.avif?t=1755534344\" width=630 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417650/extras/54163e2f6973d65fdae2b4075a511156.webm?t=1755534344\" type=\"video/webm; codec